      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market with Tony Donnelly of Leonard Wilson Keenan, this fantastic four-bedroom detached bungalow offers the perfect blend of modern luxury, energy efficiency, and tranquil rural living. Boasting an impressive B energy rating, this pristine family home is packed with premium upgrades and is ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nKey Features & Modern Upgrades\r\n\r\n•\tEnergy Efficient: B-rated energy efficiency with a flexible dual heating system and a modern EV electric car charger.\r\n•\tPremium Security & Access: Secure entry via electric gates opening onto a pristine tarmacadam driveway with ample parking.\r\n•\tTurn-Key Condition: The property has been meticulously maintained and comes to the market in pristine, walk-in condition throughout.\r\n•\tOutdoor Oasis: Beautifully landscaped gardens wrap around the home, featuring a quiet rural backdrop with panoramic countryside views to the rear\r\n\r\n\t\r\nSpacious & Thoughtful Accommodation\r\n\r\nLiving & Entertaining Areas\r\n\r\n•\tHeart of the Home: A spectacular, light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining area to the rear.\r\n•\tFormal Sitting Room: A bright and welcoming separate reception room positioned off the main hallway. This space features a cozy solid fuel stove and direct access to the dining area—perfect for family gatherings\r\n•\tUtility & Convenience: A fully equipped utility room and a practical guest W/C located by the back door.\r\n\r\nBedrooms & Bathrooms\r\n\r\n•\tEntrance Hallway: A bright, wide, and welcoming entrance that sets the tone for the rest of the home.\r\n•\tFour Double Bedrooms: Generously proportioned double bedrooms offering plenty of space and natural light.\r\n•\tMaster Suite: Features a private, fully fitted en-suite bathroom.\r\n•\tFamily Bathroom: A fantastic, modern main bathroom serving the remaining bedroom\r\n\r\nAn Ideal Location Situated in a peaceful, scenic rural setting just off the R414 Rathangan to Monasterevin road, this home offers country living without sacrificing connectivity:\r\n\r\n•\tSchools & Amenities: Within easy access to Rathangan town, including excellent local primary and secondary schools.\r\n•\tCommuter Friendly: A short drive to the M7 Motorway, accessible via Junction 13 (Kildare Village) or Junction 14 (Mayfield Service Station) for an easy commute to Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
